      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "Peter therefore was kept in the prison, but constant prayer was made by the assembly to God for him.",
      "ko": "이에 베드로는 옥에 갇혔고 교회는 그를 위하여 간절히 하나님께 빌더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a7bdb18e60d37c25c60408b4f4118de728a537e5c4c12aed2d35e5bb9cac0335",
      "translation_text_hash": "21915d7a916cb9a00edc5266fa49c010c7bf33e8e0fa0b28f7b122d4c15e506d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이에 베드로는 옥에 갇혔고 교회는 그를 위하여 간절히 하나님께 빌더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "21915d7a916cb9a00edc5266fa49c010c7bf33e8e0fa0b28f7b122d4c15e506d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:12:6",
