      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "And he went out and followed him. He didn’t know that what was being done by the angel was real, but thought he saw a vision.",
      "ko": "베드로가 나와서 따라갈쌔 천사의 하는 것이 참인줄 알지 못하고 환상을 보는가 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f8e89e3478fad65fdab125828377af11bdd69ef5f932ddee27d00fd44b78db6f",
      "translation_text_hash": "11d053ca5c197753dcaa6e30ad4f847b90bb03c62412100ad890f6a796f4928b",
