      "en": "Thinking about that, he came to the house of Mary, the mother of John who was called Mark, where many were gathered together and were praying.",
      "ko": "깨닫고 마가라 하는 요한의 어머니 마리아의 집에 가니 여러 사람이 모여 기도하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "548cfc4acb44209185745ef2c78dacecb38adf8d6084baa9efd34916dfa14039",
      "translation_text_hash": "acd1634cce717968fece3658a7bd2cefd5e6ed352f1e146aa4bb3223ecf96a58",
