      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "When she recognized Peter’s voice, she didn’t open the gate for joy, but ran in and reported that Peter was standing in front of the gate.",
      "ko": "베드로의 음성인줄 알고 기뻐하여 문을 미처 열지 못하고 달려 들어가 말하되 베드로가 대문 밖에 섰더라 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "d057bd983044b44d557d657d3a55e615506790b2cd7b4c539e615e3eb2ac558e",
      "translation_text_hash": "246956674fae5e11cde8620abc789db8913c74ab6f99b0d91d7b45dcffb399cd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
